    routePath: 'botifarra',
    LLM: 'Game: Botifarra. Type: Point-Trick. Rules: 48 cards. 12 tricks. Rank: 9(5)>A(4)>K(3)>Kn(2)>J(1). Must follow, must trump void. Dealer can delegate trump. No Trump = Botifarra.',
    Player: "You are the dealer. Your hand has no long suits and few high cards. Do you name a suit trumps, take the risk of 'Botifarra' (No Trump), or 'Delegar' the choice to your partner?",
    tagline: 'The 9 is King. The sausage is served. Outplay the rivals.',
